=A meeting was just booked via the website chatbot.

Name: {{ $('Confirm Meeting Booking').first().json.name }}
Email: {{ $('Confirm Meeting Booking').first().json.email }}
Meeting time: {{ $('Confirm Meeting Booking').first().json.bookedTimeDisplay }}
Website: pending (you get a second email if they share it)

Reschedule link: {{ $('Confirm Meeting Booking').first().json.rescheduleUrl || 'n/a' }}
